00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:38.460
More corn bro?!

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:39.560
- [Gideon] Corn. Yeah.

00:07:40.461 --> 00:07:41.603
We love corn in the Philippines man.

00:07:41.603 --> 00:07:42.810
So this is Boy-Bawang.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:44.760
I still remember the
first time I've had it.

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:46.590
My uncle just randomly like showed up

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:47.640
and he just tossed me a bag,

00:07:47.640 --> 00:07:49.080
he's like "Here, you're welcome".

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:50.790
And I'm like "Okay".

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:52.530
