00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:53.363
- Multiple.

00:07:55.617 --> 00:07:57.367
- Hmm

00:07:57.367 --> 00:07:58.800
It's like you didn't like it.

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:00.270
- [Owen] No that's good corn.

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:01.920
- [Gideon] This is adobo flavor.

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:03.240
