00:08:09.645 --> 00:08:10.478
- Oh, okay.

00:08:10.478 --> 00:08:11.311
But then that-

00:08:11.311 --> 00:08:12.450
my description was home point then.

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:13.830
Would I get this over chips,

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:14.730
probably not.

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:15.600
You know how airlines are like

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:17.280
here are your nuts, like peanuts.

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:19.980
I think this should be a replacement.

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:20.813
- It's better, right?

00:08:20.813 --> 00:08:22.980
- Yeah, they're better than
like regular peanuts and stuff.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:24.450
- This is the thing I used to like,

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:25.650
whenever I would eat this,

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:28.560
I'm gonna put like vinegar
just to balance it out.

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:29.393
