00:08:29.393 --> 00:08:30.226
I've never seen that.

00:08:30.226 --> 00:08:31.323
You put it in the bag?

00:08:31.323 --> 00:08:32.750
- [Gideon] Yeah just put it in the bag

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:33.660
and I just shake it.

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:35.130
But I just thought it was good.

00:08:35.130 --> 00:08:36.420
I don't know if other people would

00:08:36.420 --> 00:08:37.670
do it in the Philippines.

00:08:39.180 --> 00:08:41.580
- It doesn't taste like
straight vinegar at all.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:43.890
Just gives it that like little kick.

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:44.921
- I dunno.

00:08:44.921 --> 00:08:46.350
I think it just brings out the other

00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:47.850
