00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:15.750
Have you had this before or no?

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:16.583
- No, no, no.

00:09:16.583 --> 00:09:17.478
Oh dude,

00:09:17.478 --> 00:09:18.311
