00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:26.580
It's just like, it's unreal.

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:28.110
It's all over my lips.

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:28.980
- Yeah, it's very messy.

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:30.360
- I kind of want some milk.

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:31.740
like isn't that,

00:09:31.740 --> 00:09:33.210
like just so good.

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:34.265
Come on.

00:09:34.265 --> 00:09:35.098
- It's really good yeah.

00:09:35.098 --> 00:09:36.090
